/**
 * Secure implementation of an Atom provider.
 *
 * The {@code readFrom} method now creates a fresh {@link Parser} instance
 * with a dedicated {@link ParserOptions} object that explicitly disables
 * entity resolution.  This eliminates the XXE risk that existed when the
