     * Country part (optional): 2 alphabetic characters preceded by '-' or '_' .
     * Variant part (optional): alphanumeric characters preceded by '-' or '_' .
     */
    private static final Pattern LOCALE_PATTERN =
            Pattern.compile("^[a-zA-Z]{2,3}([-_][a-zA-Z]{2})?([-_][a-zA-Z0-9]+)?$");

