     *       required by {@link InputStream#read(byte[],int,int)}).</li>
     *   <li>Detects EOF from the underlying stream even when the expected entry
     *       size has not been reached.</li>
     *   <li>Never returns a zero byte count for a non‑zero {@code length},
     *       thereby preventing infinite‑loop scenarios.</li>
     *   <li>Validates the number of bytes to return against the known entry size
     *       and the internal buffer limits.</li>
     * </ul>
